{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f1aeb5f-7b78-4c2c-a75d-8f722a1d3b8f",
    "name": "HanSim Hair Color Academy API",
    "description": "Postman collection for all Express routes mounted under `/api`.\n\nBody parsing used by the server:\n- Global JSON parser: `express.json()` for `application/json` bodies.\n- Global URL-encoded parser: `bodyParser.urlencoded({ extended: true })` for `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` bodies.\n- Stripe webhook raw parser: `/api/payment/webhook` uses `express.raw({ type: \"application/json\" })`; keep the body as raw JSON and include Stripe's `Stripe-Signature` header.\n\nAuthentication:\n- JWT-protected routes use `Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}` and are verified with `JWT_SECRET`.\n- Firebase-protected routes use `Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseToken}}` and are verified with Firebase Admin.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
